# Assets Directory
This directory contains all the media assets for the portfolio website.

## Required Files:
- profile.jpg - Your professional headshot (circular crop recommended)
- logos/ - Company and project logos
- thumbs/ - Project thumbnail images

## Image Specifications:
- profile.jpg: 400x400px minimum, square aspect ratio
- Project thumbnails: 600x400px recommended
- Company logos: SVG preferred, or PNG with transparent background

